cat << 'EOF' > _posts/2026-10-09-clat-prep.md\
---\
layout: default\
title: "Transitioning to Digital Gardens"\
date: 2026-10-09\
---\
\
# Transitioning to Digital Gardens\
\
Writing in plain markdown and compiling it with Jekyll feels incredibly similar to typesetting documents in LaTeX. \
\
I set up this space to track my reading of *Assembling India's Constitution* and to keep a log of my CLAT mock scores. Because Jekyll handles the HTML generation, I only have to worry about the raw text.\
\
### Study Notes for Today\
* Completed legal reasoning module.\
* Read two chapters of Khaled Hosseini.\
EOF
