# 3. Create the Master Layout (with relative URLs, unclipped toggle, and favicon)\
cat << 'EOF' > _layouts/default.html\
<!DOCTYPE html>\
<html lang="en">\
<head>\
    <meta charset="UTF-8">\
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">\
    <title>{{ page.title }}</title>\
    <!-- Bulletproof paths for GitHub Pages -->\
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/styles.css' | relative_url }}">\
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="{{ '/favicon.svg' | relative_url }}">\
    <script>\
        const theme = localStorage.getItem('theme') || (window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches ? 'dark' : 'light');\
        document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);\
    </script>\
</head>\
<body>\
    <main>\
        <div class="header-nav">\
            <button onclick="toggleTheme()" class="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Theme">\
                <svg class="sun-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="-2 -2 28 28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">\
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"></circle>\
                    <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"></line>\
                    <line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"></line>\
                    <line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"></line>\
                    <line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"></line>\
                    <line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"></line>\
                    <line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"></line>\
                    <line x1="4.22" y1="19.78" x2="5.64" y2="18.36"></line>\
                    <line x1="18.36" y1="4.22" x2="19.78" y2="5.64"></line>\
                </svg>\
                <svg class="moon-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">\
                    <path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"></path>\
                </svg>\
            </button>\
        </div>\
        \
        {{ content }}\
        \
    </main>\
\
    <script>\
        function toggleTheme() {\
            const current = document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-theme');\
            const next = current === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';\
            document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', next);\
            localStorage.setItem('theme', next);\
        }\
    </script>\
</body>\
</html>\
EOF\
\
# 4. Create the Homepage\
cat << 'EOF' > index.html\
---\
layout: default\
title: Rudra Asthana\
---\
\
<h1>Rudra Asthana</h1>\
\
<p>Welcome to my digital garden. I am a student, writer, and open-source tinkerer. I built this space to cultivate my notes in plain text, prioritizing reading comfort and clean typography over algorithmic timelines.</p>\
\
<p>My interests are scattered across a few different disciplines. I am deeply interested in physics research and the logistics of climate change solutions, while simultaneously exploring Indian constitutional history and modern Hindi literature. On a given weekend, you will usually find me reading Khaled Hosseini, exploring the financial markets on Zerodha, or volunteering as an editor on Wikipedia.</p>\
\
<h2>Projects & Hobbies</h2>\
<p>I have a strong background in Model United Nations, having served enthusiastically as a Director General, Vice-Chairperson, and Executive Board member. I spent a significant amount of time drafting procedural frameworks and background guides for various committees.</p>\
<p>Digitally, I am passionate about Linux customization. I daily-drive Arch Linux and spend time writing Bash scripts, formatting complex documents in LaTeX, and experimenting with Python, Go, and C++. When I want to disconnect, I usually spin up Genshin Impact, Minecraft, or Ultrakill.</p>\
\
<h2>Guides & Manuals</h2>\
<ul class="post-list">\
  {% for post in site.categories.guide %}\
    <li>\
      <span class="post-meta">{{ post.date | date: "%Y-%m-%d" }}</span> \
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.title }}</a>\
    </li>\
  {% else %}\
    <li style="color: var(--subtext0); font-style: italic;">Manuals are currently being compiled.</li>\
  {% endfor %}\
</ul>\
\
<h2>Blog & Reflections</h2>\
<ul class="post-list">\
  {% for post in site.categories.blog %}\
    <li>\
      <span class="post-meta">{{ post.date | date: "%Y-%m-%d" }}</span> \
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.title }}</a>\
    </li>\
  {% else %}\
    <li style="color: var(--subtext0); font-style: italic;">No logs published yet.</li>\
  {% endfor %}\
</ul>\
\
<hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--surface0); margin: 4rem 0 2rem 0;">\
\
<ul class="social-links">\
