# 3. Update the Homepage to include the "Typeset Documents" category\
cat << 'EOF' > index.html\
---\
layout: default\
title: Rudra Asthana\
---\
\
<h1>Rudra Asthana</h1>\
\
<p>Welcome to my digital garden. I am a student, writer, and open-source tinkerer. I built this space to cultivate my notes in plain text, prioritizing reading comfort and clean typography over algorithmic timelines.</p>\
\
<p>My interests are scattered across a few different disciplines. I am deeply interested in physics research and the logistics of climate change solutions, while simultaneously exploring Indian constitutional history and modern Hindi literature. On a given weekend, you will usually find me reading Khaled Hosseini, exploring the financial markets on Zerodha, or volunteering as an editor on Wikipedia.</p>\
\
<h2>Projects & Hobbies</h2>\
<p>I have a strong background in Model United Nations, having served enthusiastically as a Director General, Vice-Chairperson, and Executive Board member. I spent a significant amount of time drafting procedural frameworks and background guides for various committees.</p>\
<p>Digitally, I am passionate about Linux customization. I daily-drive Arch Linux and spend time writing Bash scripts, formatting complex documents in LaTeX, and experimenting with Python, Go, and C++. When I want to disconnect, I usually spin up Genshin Impact, Minecraft, or Ultrakill.</p>\
\
<h2>Typeset Documents</h2>\
<ul class="post-list">\
  {% for post in site.categories.typeset %}\
    <li>\
      <span class="post-meta">{{ post.date | date: "%Y-%m-%d" }}</span> \
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.title }}</a>\
    </li>\
  {% else %}\
    <li style="color: var(--subtext0); font-style: italic;">No documents uploaded yet.</li>\
  {% endfor %}\
</ul>\
\
<h2>Guides & Manuals</h2>\
<ul class="post-list">\
  {% for post in site.categories.guide %}\
    <li>\
      <span class="post-meta">{{ post.date | date: "%Y-%m-%d" }}</span> \
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.title }}</a>\
    </li>\
  {% else %}\
    <li style="color: var(--subtext0); font-style: italic;">Manuals are currently being compiled.</li>\
  {% endfor %}\
</ul>\
\
<h2>Blog & Reflections</h2>\
